From 84f5bfdfd3eedcf67b3fd45f53fb80b0ccf6633f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daemonhorn <dhorn2000@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 10:54:39 -0400
Subject: [PATCH qemu-server 6/6] test: add riscv64 cfg2cmd fixtures

Adds three cfg2cmd fixtures, matching aarch64's existing coverage:
default host with a riscv64 guest, a native riscv64 host, and a
riscv64 host running an x86_64 guest. The default-host fixture
additionally exercises the TPM and UART serial paths added earlier in
this series.

Verified against a real installed Perl stack and real QEMU binaries:
the full existing suite (102 default-arch + 3 aarch64 fixtures) has
zero regressions, and all three new fixtures pass.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: daemonhorn <dhorn2000@gmail.com>
